message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Robotic Symbiosis in Heterogeneous Multi-Agent Warehouse Systems"
abstract: >
  A formal framework for measuring, classifying, and shaping ecological
  relationship types (mutualism, commensalism, parasitism, competition)
  in heterogeneous multi-agent reinforcement learning, evaluated on
  battery-enabled task-assignment robotic warehouse scenarios.
authors:
